    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1131880/extras/02cb39a72927affe23d13d6b5ae84af3.avif?t=1614552799\" /></div><br>When he\u2019s not studying cosmic meta-algebra, teen earthling Henry Mosse helps his mother Seren operate Mosse Family Supplies - galactic delivery is much more fun than dividing the cubic-space of infinity by one solar parsec! Yet still Henry longs to break free of his domestic life and seek fame amongst the mysterious Far Star Galaxy!<br><br>When a too-good-to-be-true business opportunity leads the Mosses to the mysterious Cape Coocoo, they find themselves at the epicentre of a sinister cosmic conspiracy, and an adventure is set in motion that will determine the fate of the Mosses and the Far Star Galaxy.<br><br>Embark on an interplanetary journey of danger, empathy and self-discovery - ultimately fulfilling a secret legacy founded a generation ago.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1131880/extras/f5d59ceb42380267960529583a1e8464.avif?t=1614552799\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1131880/extras/5b99b62cde23fcab0d3bc7b5ffee4082.avif?t=1614552799\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Branching puzzles that cater to differing styles of play</strong><br></li><li> <strong>A dynamic score that progressively reacts to your path</strong><br></li><li> <strong>A stellar cast of voice actors</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Helpful gadgets for highlighting objects and offering progressive puzzle hints</strong><br></li><li> <strong>A universe to explore with over forty gorgeous environments and over forty interesting characters</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Beautiful cinematic cutscenes that will captivate you</strong></li></ul><br><div class=\"bb